&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:88.8pt;padding-right:9pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-28.8pt;"&gt;(注)  配当金の総額には、株式付与ESOP信託が保有する当社株式に対する配当金が含まれております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:DividendPolicyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DateOfResolutionDividendsOfSurplus contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">2023-11-08</jpcrp_cor:DateOfResolutionDividendsOfSurplus>
  <jpcrp_cor:ResolutionDividendsOfSurplus contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row1Member">取締役会決議</jpcrp_cor:ResolutionDividendsOfSurplus>
  <jpcrp_cor:DateOfResolutionDividendsOfSurplus contextRef="FilingDateInstant_Row2Member">2024-06-24</jpcrp_cor:DateOfResolutionDividendsOfSurplus>
