  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingTradeNotesReceivableDiscountedOrTransferredByEndorsementTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;  ２  受取手形裏書譲渡高&lt;/p&gt;
