&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:68.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(b) 税務上の繰越欠損金は、法定実効税率を乗じた額であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;２  法定実効税率と税効果会計適用後の法人税等の負担率との間に重要な差異があるときの、当該差異の原因となった主要な項目別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;法定実効税率と税効果会計適用後の法人税等の負担率との間の差異が法定実効税率の100分の５以下であるため注記を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:50pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-23pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:50pt;padding-right:9pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-23pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesAssetRetirementObligationsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:4.5pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;(資産除去債務関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;資産除去債務の総額に重要性が乏しいため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesAssetRetirementObligationsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRealEstateForLeaseEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:4.5pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;(賃貸等不動産関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;賃貸等不動産の総額に重要性が乏しいため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRealEstateForLeaseEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
